{"id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-classical-propositional-calculus.md","title":"Classical Propositional Hilbert Calculus","display":"df-classical-propositional-calculus — Classical Propositional Hilbert Calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","aliases":["93-df-classical-propositional-calculus"],"display":"df-classical-propositional-calculus — Classical Propositional Hilbert Calculus","depends_on":["[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-valuation]]","[[93-df-proof]]","[[93-df-deduction]]","[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-variety]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classical-propositional-calculus — Classical Propositional Hilbert Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e0a05ab276dc277\" href=\"?note=4e0a05ab276dc277\" title=\"93-df-proof\">93-df-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7480655210b09b5d\" href=\"?note=7480655210b09b5d\" title=\"93-df-deduction\">93-df-deduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span> are the indexed formula carrier, tagged compound constructor, and explicitly tagged variable set sourced through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{93}\">\\(\\tau_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> have the signatures of the cited definitions.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The tagged connective symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, their signature, formula constructors, axiom set, modus-ponens rule, calculus, induced consequence relation, two-element truth-operation graphs and their family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CPL2OpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CPL2OpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, semantic consequence, logic object, language object, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In particular, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{And}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{And}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Or}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Or}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eqv}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eqv}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span> denote the five displayed formula-operation graphs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>；原一元辅助函数仍以载集元素为自变量，运算族中的解释以单元组为自变量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,0\\rangle,\n&amp;\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,1\\rangle,\\\\\nS^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\},\n&amp;\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},2\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},1\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle S^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,0\\rangle,\n&amp;\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,1\\rangle,\\\\\nS^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\},\n&amp;\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},2\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},1\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle S^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\nF^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{9